[stderr] +
[stderr] +Preserve all accepted work and use monotonic B/R/IMP IDs. Do not infer approval
[stderr] +from a gate or from a queued state. A selected expansion must include stable
[stderr] +requirement links, ownership, dependencies, non-goals, platform distinctions,
[stderr] +verification, asset assessment, and canonical sources; validate coverage,
