[stderr] +IDs and that no more than ten B tasks were created. Confirm the successor/final
[stderr] +audit choice against the remaining queued chapters and ready unassigned
[stderr] +contracts. Stop and report any source conflict, missing coverage, cycle,
[stderr] +collision, unresolved authority, or need to overwrite accepted work.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Checkpoint and update procedure
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Atomically update the JSON and Markdown ledgers with chapter state, allocations,
[stderr] +counters, and the D0002 checkpoint only after validation. Retain reserved IDs
[stderr] +on repair; never renumber, replace, or rewrite an accepted B/R contract.
[stderr] +
