[stderr] +- At most ten new B-series authoring runbooks, each owning no more than seven
[stderr] +  newly assigned R-series outputs.
[stderr] +- Exactly one successor dispatcher or one final audit B-series task, selected
[stderr] +  only after the queue and ready-contract check.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Required behaviour
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Preserve all accepted work and use monotonic B/R/IMP IDs. Do not infer approval
[stderr] +from a gate or from a queued state. A selected expansion must include stable
[stderr] +requirement links, ownership, dependencies, non-goals, platform distinctions,
