 installability, offline reload, cache rollback/update-at-safe-boundary, storage pressure, and all shared checks. |\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/03-technical-contract.md:182:| Accessibility and performance | Keyboard-operable menus, semantic labels, visible focus, readable scalable text, captions, non-colour cues, settings persistence, responsive phone/tablet/desktop checks. Establish approval-gated performance budgets for initial load, interaction frame time, memory, bundle/cache size, and slow-network behaviour before release. | Same accessibility/performance requirements, plus offline messaging, update state, install prompt alternatives, and no inaccessible full-screen/install-only path. Measure cold/warm/offline startup and cache size. |\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/03-technical-contract.md:194:in development, release/version/cache status visible in support UI, and an\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/03-technical-contract.md:208:could overwrite the last known-good state, an update can activate mid-combat or\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/implementation-catalogue-index.json:6:  \"first_bounded_domain\": {\"id\": \"SHARD-01\", \"title\": \"Foundation and core contracts\", \"contract_limit\": 250, \"contract_count\": 12, \"state\": \"ready_for_authoring\", \"boundary\": \"Framework-neutral seams, deterministic state/data contracts, local persistence protocol, quality foundations, and original-design controls; excludes campaign rules, UI flows, PWA lifecycle, and release execution.\"},\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/implementation-catalogue-index.json:8:    {\"id\":\"IMP-0001\",\"title\":\"Bootstrap reproducible shared project baseline\",\"domain\":\"foundation\",\"targets\":[\"shared\",\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"NFR-0010\",\"NFR-0012\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"A framework-neutral project skeleton documents one bootstrap, lint, format, and deterministic test command with isolated shared, web-adapter, PWA-adapter, content, and test directories.\",\"prerequisites\":[],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"root build/tooling configuration\",\"src/{core,content,app,platform/web,platform/pwa}/\",\"tests/\",\"docs/development.md\"],\"data\":[\"pinned toolchain declaration\"],\"api\":[\"build/test command interface\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"selecting framework/package manager/CI without DEC-0001\",\"gameplay\",\"service worker\",\"hosting\"],\"verification\":\"Clean approved-runtime checkout runs the documented deterministic sample test, lint, and format checks.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0001 / DEC-0001 framework, package-manager, and CI selection before implementation.\",\"complexity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"gated\"},\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/implementation-catalogue-index.json:9:    {\"id\":\"IMP-0002\",\"title\":\"Enforce shared-core and adapter dependency seams\",\"domain\":\"foundation\",\"targets\":[\"shared\",\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"NFR-0010\",\"REQ-0013\",\"NFR-0012\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"A dependency policy and public interfaces prevent core code from importing browser, renderer, clock, network, or platform modules; adapters submit commands and render returned state/events.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0001\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"src/core/public interfaces\",\"src/platform/{web,pwa}/adapter interfaces\",\"architecture dependency rules\",\"docs/architecture.md\"],\"data\":[\"dependency-policy manifest\"],\"api\":[\"Command, state, event, and adapter interfaces\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"concrete combat/exploration/UI\",\"account or network client\",\"target-specific campaign rules\"],\"verification\":\"A dependency-rule test rejects forbidden core imports and a fixture adapter proves command-only interaction.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"None; retain GATE-0001 for tool-specific enforcement.\",\"complexity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"current\"},\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/implementation-catalogue-index.json: